# M-096 / SANGAM.md P7: code owners per area. RECORD-ONLY (owner question Q-10 is open, also Q19 / SG-18).
#
# With one maintainer this file only records ownership: GitHub asks the listed owner to review, but no merge waits for
# it. Enforcement is the branch-protection (or ruleset) setting "Require review from Code Owners" on main, plus "two
# approvals" for the core and security areas below. That switch is OFF and stays off until Q-10 is answered and a
# second maintainer exists; turning it on is a repository-settings change the owner makes, not a file change.
#
# The last matching pattern wins. When a second maintainer joins, add them to the core and security lines.

*                                   @sqamentor

# Core and security-sensitive modules (P7: two reviewers once enforced)
/sangam/sangam-core/                @sqamentor
/sangam/sangam-engine/              @sqamentor
/sangam/sangam-security/            @sqamentor
